WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:04.296
Sheila:
I used to have this mean,
critical voice in my head.

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.965
♪ "I Am What I Am" by Gloria
Gaynor ♪

00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:07.758
Shut up!

00:00:07.883 --> 00:00:10.802
Sheila:
But I committed to my recovery,
and I got better.

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:12.554
♪ So come take a look ♪

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:15.974
Sheila:
But sometimes I wonder if that
voice is what got me here.

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:19.561
♪ Give me the hook or the
ovation ♪

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:20.145
Producer:
Are you ready?

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:23.357
Oh yes. I certainly am.

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:25.901
-♪ I am what I am ♪
-[electrical buzzing]

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:28.403
Hi, I'm Sheila D. Rubin.

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:29.279
Sheila:
Let's move!

00:00:30.072 --> 00:00:32.741
Greta:
You are a national television
personality now.

00:00:33.492 --> 00:00:35.786
We're building a place for women
to be free of judgement.

00:00:35.786 --> 00:00:36.620
[cheering]

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:37.663
We should offer meditation.

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:38.121
Lamaze!

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:38.538
Yoga!

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:39.540
Pottery! Lesbians!

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:40.832
Yes! What?

00:00:40.832 --> 00:00:42.501
We're brainstorming, there's no
bad ideas!

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:43.377
Yes!

00:00:43.377 --> 00:00:45.712
Greta:
We are on the precipice of
something big.

00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:47.547
Greta:
There's just one problem.

00:00:47.631 --> 00:00:50.509
♪ I am what I am ♪

00:00:50.509 --> 00:00:51.760
Greta:
Kelly Kilmartin.

00:00:51.969 --> 00:00:52.928
Ernie:
She beat you to the punch.

00:00:53.637 --> 00:00:55.472
Greta:
She's the most famous fitness
star.

00:00:55.973 --> 00:00:57.266
I'm better than you.

00:00:57.266 --> 00:01:00.143
♪ I bang my own drum ♪

00:01:00.143 --> 00:01:00.394
Sheila:
Oh no.

00:01:00.394 --> 00:01:01.895
They're looking at you.

00:01:01.979 --> 00:01:03.355
Sheila:
She's in my head.

00:01:04.147 --> 00:01:05.857
Kelly:
Fame begets scrutiny.

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:07.818
She's fake and a liar.

00:01:08.235 --> 00:01:11.571
Every time I think you have hit
bottom you manage to sink even
lower.

00:01:11.655 --> 00:01:13.490
This is really starting to scare
me.

00:01:13.699 --> 00:01:15.325
You don't want to slow down now,
do you?

00:01:15.617 --> 00:01:16.868
John:
So close to the top.

00:01:17.327 --> 00:01:18.704
Greta:
I was hoping it wouldn't come to
this.

00:01:19.162 --> 00:01:21.206
Just kidding I was dying for it
to come to this.

00:01:21.248 --> 00:01:21.790
Greta:
It's go time.

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:25.919
This is more than just a
business for me, this is my
life!

00:01:26.169 --> 00:01:27.212
Sheila:
I built this.

00:01:27.838 --> 00:01:29.548
Sheila:
I am Body by Sheila.

00:01:30.215 --> 00:01:33.218
♪ I am what I am ♪

00:01:33.218 --> 00:01:34.636
You're just hanging on by a
thread.

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:36.430
Kelly:
Just waiting for that moment to
snap.

00:01:36.555 --> 00:01:37.472
Leave me alone!

00:01:37.556 --> 00:01:39.057
Kelly:
I thought you were on a healing
journey.

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:40.892
I am on a healing journey!

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:43.186
We have put everything on the line!

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:43.812
[tires screech]

00:01:43.812 --> 00:01:44.688
Greta:
What if it doesn't work?

00:01:45.814 --> 00:01:47.024
I won't let it happen.

00:01:48.442 --> 00:01:48.984
[gun clicks]

00:01:49.401 --> 00:01:52.821
Isn't one of the steps in your
recovery, integrity?

00:01:52.821 --> 00:01:54.114
Recovery's a long road.

00:01:54.865 --> 00:01:57.826
♪ I am what I am ♪

